### Login link to get the one-time authorization code
GET http://localhost:9090/realms/energyregistry-realm/protocol/openid-connect/auth?client_id=energyregistry-app&response_type=code&
    scope=openid%20profile%20email&redirect_uri=http://localhost:8081/callback&prompt=login

### Logout
GET http://localhost:9090/realms/energyregistry-realm/protocol/openid-connect/logout

### GET token with MFA
POST http://localhost:9090/realms/energyregistry-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type = authorization_code &
client_id = {{client_id}} &
redirect_uri = {{redirect_uri}} &
code = {{code}}

<> 2026-06-26T161350.200.json

### GET token with Direct grant
POST http://localhost:9090/realms/energyregistry-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type = password &
client_id = {{client_id}} &
username = {{username}} &
password = {{password}} &
totp = {{otp}}

